00:04:59.093 --> 00:05:00.197
Oh, is that ground chuck, man?

00:05:00.197 --> 00:05:01.590
(laughs) No offense,

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:04.183
I ain't trying to park my
Bentley next to your Toyota,

00:05:04.183 --> 00:05:05.318
