00:05:08.755 --> 00:05:10.290
Yeah, all right.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.123
- Hey, relax, man.

00:05:11.123 --> 00:05:11.956
I'm gonna cook them good.

00:05:11.956 --> 00:05:13.110
- Okay. (chuckles) Yeah.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.850
- All right, so how's Theresa doing?

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:15.780
- She's good. She's good.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:16.890
She's sad she couldn't be here.

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:18.120
You know, she's got a closing today.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:20.730
You want to flash-cook those,
because they're real lean.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:22.080
You know, they're grass-fed.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.844
So you just want to probably
flip them right-right now.

00:05:24.844 --> 00:05:25.991
All right.

00:05:25.991 --> 00:05:27.705
- Hey, who wants cheese on their burger?

00:05:27.705 --> 00:05:29.640
- Nobody, nobody. Nobody wants cheese!

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:30.750
- Anybody want a double burger?

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.250
- No, nobody wants a double burger.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.083
We're not gonna double.

00:05:33.083 --> 00:05:35.520
That's like putting a
diamond ring on a pig hoof.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.650
I'm sorry, but the grass
that these cows ate

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:38.563
costs more than this house.

00:05:38.563 --> 00:05:40.039
- All right, no double burgers.

00:05:40.039 --> 00:05:41.220
- Right, no double-

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:42.720
- Hey. What the hell?

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.070
- You may as well just poop on that.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:44.903
- What?

00:05:44.903 --> 00:05:47.550
- You just ketchup-raped my Kobe burger.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.650
This was a mistake. This...

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.660
No, no, no. Uh-uh.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.830
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.260
See, this meat came all the way over here

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:58.890
form the Pacific Ocean by boat,

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:02.043
