wouldn't ruin its integrity.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:04.800
Give me that.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.148
You are not worthy.

00:06:06.148 --> 00:06:07.986
Give me that burger.

00:06:07.986 --> 00:06:09.720
This is ridiculous. This is 126...

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.525
Oh, this little mother...

00:06:11.525 --> 00:06:12.667
(dog whimpers)

00:06:12.667 --> 00:06:14.250
$126 worth of beef.

00:06:16.988 --> 00:06:18.405
Y'all not worthy.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:21.444
