pie with bacon pineapple

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.980
and cheesy crust.

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:49.410
- Large bacon pineapple
with cheesy crust, okay.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:51.090
Is that gonna complete your order, sir?

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.800
