00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:55.320
Uh, guys, are we gonna want another pizza?

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:56.153
Let me just...

00:06:56.153 --> 00:06:57.240
Who's hungry? Show of hands.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:58.470
Let me see 'em.

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:03.131
One, two, three-- keep
'em up-- four, five, six.

00:07:03.131 --> 00:07:05.010
