00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:06.570
- Yeah, pretty big one, too.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:07.980
Come on, guys, keep 'em up.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:10.350
Hugo, Summer, Hans, food?

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:12.270
You know what, let's play it safe.

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:15.600
Let's get another pie with ham pineapple.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.190
- All right, ham.

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:19.020
Oh, you guys gonna need
cheesy crust on that third?

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.850
- Good question, I'll gauge the room.

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:24.070
Hey, guys, do we want
cheesy crust on the third?

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.980
Okay, yeesh.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:30.980
That is a resounding yes for
cheesy crust on the third.

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:33.448
Claire says you read her mind.

00:07:33.448 --> 00:07:35.340
- Claire, huh? I like that name.

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:36.540
- It's a good one.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.840
Oh, also, my boy Andy over here is saying

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.510
you have something called chicken poppers?

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:43.480
- Is she cute?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.270
- [Customer] Who's that, and what now?

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.147
- Claire.

00:07:46.147 --> 00:07:48.990
- Oh.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.460
Her body's like a four.

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.260
Anyway, we would also-

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:54.010
- [Carlos] Well, h-how do you mean?

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:59.310
- Ha. Let's just say
she's kind of a big girl.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.540
- That's all good.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:01.980
That's all superficial, man.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.540
I like Claire for what's inside.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.373
- You don't even know Claire.

00:08:04.373 --> 00:08:05.670
- Yo, but for real though,

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.370
I feel like I do know Claire, man.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:09.730
Put me on the phone with her.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:12.153
- Uh.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:15.870
You don't need to speak to Claire.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:16.863
- No, I do.

00:08:18.645 --> 00:08:21.090
- (sighs) You know what?

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:23.190
I gotta level with you, man.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.187
I (bleep) her.

00:08:26.697 --> 00:08:27.763
- Oh! Oh, I'm sorry.

00:08:27.763 --> 00:08:30.720
I-I didn't mean to get
in between you guys.

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:34.530
- No, it's quite all right. (chuckles)

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:37.533
- 'Twas a while ago,
before she blimped up.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.550
My current girlfriend's Liv.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.260
Body, 10.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:45.573
Face, 10.

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:52.190
But anyway, Claire, yeah,
I hit that sexually.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:54.750
And, uh, as did my boy Hugo.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.030
Hell, even Bubba got some of that.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:00.780
So just wanted you to know,
used goods, used goods.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:03.630
- So you wouldn't care if I asked her out?

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:04.550
- Well...

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.200
Let me do it for you.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.790
Hey, Claire, this guy from the pizza place

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:09.990
wants to date you, too poor?

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:11.190
All right, I'll let him down easy.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.088
- Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, no!

00:09:13.088 --> 00:09:15.300
