00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:19.200
Tell her that no, I'm not a rich man.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.700
But I'm a good man.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.253
Tell her, "Claire, I believe in destiny.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:26.760
And I believe that we've always known

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.980
that our soulmate was out there.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:31.980
The moment that we had
that unspoken connection

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.213
about the cheesy crust,

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.813
I realized that you were always the one.

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:40.503
Because, and I know this sounds corny,

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:42.753
but that moment,

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:45.413
was just like

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:48.876
simple.

00:09:48.876 --> 00:09:51.709
(emotional music)

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:59.084
- Wow. You really do care about Claire.

00:09:59.084 --> 00:10:00.900
(Carlos chuckles)

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.563
- I do.

00:10:02.563 --> 00:10:03.396
