00:10:03.396 --> 00:10:05.124
- Oh, my God, Claire just got shot!

00:10:05.124 --> 00:10:05.957
- What? No!

00:10:05.957 --> 00:10:07.701
- Oh, it just came through
the window, it was a bullet!

00:10:07.701 --> 00:10:08.783
